        "name": "Auth Service",
        "description": "Complete API collection for the Auth Service.\n\n**Base URL:** `{{baseUrl}}`  (default: `http://localhost:5501`)\n\n**Auth:** Most protected endpoints use `httpOnly` cookies (`accessToken` / `refreshToken`) set automatically after login or register. No manual token handling is needed when using Postman with cookie support enabled.\n\n**Roles:**\n- `customer` – self-registered users\n- `manager` – tenant-scoped staff (created by admin)\n- `admin` – platform admin",
        "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
    },
    "variable": [
        {
            "key": "baseUrl",
            "value": "http://localhost:5501",
            "type": "string"
        },
        {
            "key": "tenantId",
            "value": "1",
